            "availability": "SOURCE_SUPPORTED",
            "literal_kind": "verbal",
            "instructional_role": "prerequisite",
            "refs": ["Q0013"],
            "related_refs": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Most of the time we use the public access modifier in front of class and method declarations.",
